# SCENE · buy one piece of Robotics stock at the bench: $1 is its row, $2 the tier that holds it.
# The bench opens only once a Matrixtank is grown (scenes/grow-a-matrixtank.play), and Robotics
# opens on its tiers, one page each.

run /shop
key enter
select Robotics
key enter
select $2
key enter
expect Price/unit
select $1
snap the $2 page with $1 marked
key enter
expect < 1 >
snap the counter for one $1
key enter
key esc
key esc
key esc
key esc
absent Price/unit
